  </div>

  <!-- Videos -->
  <div class="video-section">
    <div class="video-section-header">
      <h2>Watch & Learn</h2>
      <p>Quick videos to help you get the most out of Bookwize and grow your business.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="video-grid">
    <div class="video-card">
      <h3>What Booking Used to Feel Like</h3>
      <p>Remember the chaos before online booking? Missed calls, forgotten appointments, and sticky-note schedules. There's a better way.</p>
      <div class="video-wrapper">
        <video controls preload="metadata" playsinline>
          <source src="/videos/what-booking-used-to-feel-like.mp4" type="video/mp4">
        </video>
