    </div>

    <div class="video-card">
      <h3>The DM Back-and-Forth That Never Ends</h3>
      <p>Tired of booking clients through Instagram DMs and texts? See why business owners are switching to a smarter way to manage appointments.</p>
      <div class="video-wrapper">
        <video controls preload="metadata" playsinline>
          <source src="/videos/dm-back-and-forth.mp4" type="video/mp4">
        </video>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="video-card">
      <h3>Bookwize Multi-Business Testimonial</h3>
      <p>Hear from real business owners who use Bookwize to manage multiple locations and keep their clients coming back.</p>
      <div class="video-wrapper">
        <video controls preload="metadata" playsinline>
          <source src="/videos/bookwize-testimonial.mp4" type="video/mp4">
        </video>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Community Plea CTA -->
  <div class="community-plea">
    <div class="plea-box">
      <h2>Don't Be a Stranger</h2>
      <p>We're a small team building something we truly believe in. Every follow, comment, and share means the world to us. Join the community — we're building this for you.</p>
      <div class="social-row">
        <a href="https://www.instagram.com/bookwizeapp" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="social-link">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="2" y="2" width="20" height="20" rx="5"/><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="5"/><circle cx="17.5" cy="6.5" r="1" fill="currentColor" stroke="none"/></svg>
